# Mark vendored llama-cpp-sys-2 as third-party so:
#   - GitHub's "Languages" stats ignore it
#   - GitHub PR diffs collapse it by default
#   - `git diff` won't bury changes in our actual source
# The only file we modify here is llama.cpp/src/llama-mmap.cpp
# (Android Bionic POSIX_MADV fix — see src-tauri/Cargo.toml [patch.crates-io]).
vendor/** linguist-vendored
vendor/** linguist-generated=false
